msgstr "SQL dimatikan di Pengaturan MCP, jadi Izinkan SQL tidak bisa dicentang."

#. module: kaitech_mcp_server
#: model:ir.ui.view,arch_db:kaitech_mcp_server.view_mcp_key_form
msgid ""
"SQL runs as the database itself: it bypasses Odoo access rights, record rules, constraints,\n"
"                                computed fields and tracking. Tick only the tables this client truly needs. Updates and deletes\n"
"                                need a where condition and change at most 20 rows per call; every statement is in the call log."
msgstr ""
"SQL berjalan sebagai database itu sendiri: ia melewati hak akses Odoo, record rule, constraint,\n"
"                                field terhitung, dan tracking. Centang hanya tabel yang benar-benar dibutuhkan klien ini. Ubah dan hapus\n"
"                                wajib memakai kondisi where dan mengubah paling banyak 20 baris per panggilan; setiap statement tercatat di log panggilan."

#. module: kaitech_mcp_server
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:kaitech_mcp_server.field_kaitech_mcp_key_allow_sql
msgid "SQL runs as the database itself: it bypasses Odoo access rights, record rules, constraints, computed fields and tracking. Only the tables listed below can be used, and only when SQL is also switched on in MCP Settings."
msgstr "SQL berjalan sebagai database itu sendiri: ia melewati hak akses Odoo, record rule, constraint, field terhitung, dan tracking. Hanya tabel di daftar bawah yang bisa dipakai, dan hanya bila SQL juga dihidupkan di Pengaturan MCP."

