#: model:ir.ui.view,arch_db:kaitech_mcp_server.view_mcp_key_form
msgid ""
"The client can learn how this database works on its own: models, fields,\n"
"                                                methods and their overrides per module, views, menus and actions, and the\n"
"                                                source files of the installed modules. No records are read this way, and\n"
"                                                no file outside the addons folders."
msgstr "Klien dapat mempelajari sendiri cara kerja database ini: model, field, metode beserta override-nya per modul, view, menu, dan aksi, serta berkas sumber modul yang terpasang. Tidak ada record yang dibaca lewat jalur ini, dan tidak ada berkas di luar folder addons."

#. module: kaitech_mcp_server
#: model:ir.ui.view,arch_db:kaitech_mcp_server.view_mcp_key_form
msgid ""
"The client can run public business methods, such as confirming an order, on\n"
"                                                the models ticked Call methods on the Models tab. They run as the user of\n"
"                                                this key, so its access rights and record rules apply. Private methods and\n"
"                                                write, unlink and the other ORM methods are always refused. A dry run\n"
"                                                executes the method and undoes every database change."
msgstr "Klien dapat menjalankan metode bisnis publik, misalnya mengonfirmasi pesanan, pada model yang dicentang Panggil metode di tab Model. Metode berjalan sebagai user kunci ini, sehingga hak akses dan record rule-nya berlaku. Metode privat serta write, unlink, dan metode ORM lain selalu ditolak. Uji coba menjalankan metode lalu membatalkan setiap perubahan database."

#. module: kaitech_mcp_server
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:kaitech_mcp_server.field_kaitech_mcp_key_allow_methods model:ir.model.fields,help:kaitech_mcp_server.field_kaitech_mcp_permission_methods_allowed
msgid "The client may call public business methods (for example action_confirm) on the models ticked Call methods on the Models tab, as the user of this key, so Odoo access rights and record rules still apply. Private methods and ORM methods such as write or unlink are always refused."
msgstr "Klien boleh memanggil metode bisnis publik (misalnya action_confirm) pada model yang dicentang Panggil metode di tab Model, sebagai user kunci ini, sehingga hak akses Odoo dan record rule tetap berlaku. Metode privat dan metode ORM seperti write atau unlink selalu ditolak."

